<h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3">Default environment</h2>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3">Shipped with the tool and applied as defaults when run via <code class="text-xs bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">forest global run</code>. A value you export in your own shell always wins.</p>
